{"text": "But his strength soon gave out, and after falling many times, he sat down and decided to meet death with dignity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pictured the boys coming along the trail the next day, and it seemed that he was with them, looking for himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Freezing was not as bad as people thought, he told himself, and he felt strangely warm and comfortable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You were right, old hoss, you were right, he whispered to the old timer of Sulphur Creek in his mind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he drifted into the most comfortable and satisfying sleep that he had ever known, and he never woke again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never in its life had the dog seen a man sit like that in the snow and make no fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As darkness came, it crept close to the man and caught the scent of death, which made it back away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It howled once under the stars that leaped and danced in the cold sky, and then it turned and trotted up the trail. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was going toward the camp it knew, where there were other men who could give it food and fire.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "u", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "n", "g", "t", "h", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n", " ", "g", "a", "v", "e", " ", "o", "u", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", "i", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "e", "c", "i", "d", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", "e", "t", " ", "d", "e", "a", "t", "h", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "d", "i", "g", "n", "i", "t", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "p", "i", "c", "t", "u", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", "s", " ", "c", "o", "m", "i", "n", "g", " "